    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-act-2003#sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-heritage-council-act-2003.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-council-act-2003.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nassociate member means a person holding an appointment under\nsubsection 7(4).\nChair means the Chair of the Council.\nCouncil means the Australian Heritage Council established under\nsection 4.\nmeet the registration criterion has the meaning given by\nsubsection 22(2).\nmember includes the Chair and an associate member.\n\n(2) Except where the contrary intention appears, other expressions\nused in this Act have the same meaning as in the Environment\nProtection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999.\n\n\nEstablishment of the Council  Part 2\n\nSection 4\n\nAustralian Heritage Council Act 2003\nCompilation date: 1/7/19\nRegistered: 1/7/19",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nassociate member means a person holding an appointment under\nsubsection 7(4).\nChair means the Chair of the Council.\nCouncil means the Australian Heritage Council established under\nsection 4.\nmeet the registration criterion has the meaning given by\nsubsection 22(2).\nmember includes the Chair and an associate member.\n\n(2) Except where the contrary intention appears, other expressions\nused in this Act have the same meaning as in the Environment\nProtection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999.\n\n\nEstablishment of the Council  Part 2\n\nSection 4\n\nAustralian Heritage Council Act 2003\nCompilation date: 1/7/19\nRegistered: 1/7/19",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-3-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-3-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1aac56093c3ff1cf51cfecd9821873f158edb1fd8dc4814b6e00702cea4cd4be"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-heritage-council-act-2003#sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears:\nassociate member means a person holding an appointment under\nsubsection 7(4).\nChair means the Chair of the Council.\nCouncil means the Australian Heritage Council established under\nsection 4.\nmeet the registration criterion has the meaning given by\nsubsection 22(2).\nmember includes the Chair and an associate member.\n\n(2) Except where the contrary intention appears, other expressions\nused in this Act have the same meaning as in the Environment\nProtection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999.\n\n\nEstablishment of the Council  Part 2\n\nSection 4\n\nAustralian Heritage Council Act 2003\nCompilation date: 1/7/19\nRegistered: 1/7/19"
    },
