      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In appointing the members other than the Chair and associate\nmembers, the Minister must ensure that:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-7-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval for appointment",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In appointing the members other than the Chair and associate\nmembers, the Minister must ensure that:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-7-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "REASONING",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Reasoning about expertise",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) 2 of them have substantial experience or expertise concerning\nnatural heritage; and\n(b) 2 of them have substantial experience or expertise concerning\nhistoric heritage; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-7-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "SPREADS",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Spread of expertise",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) 2 of them are indigenous persons with substantial experience\nor expertise concerning indigenous heritage, at least one of whom represents the interests of indigenous people."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-heritage-council-act-2003-sec-7-ss-3-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "RECOGNITION",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Recognition of indigenous heritage experts",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) 2 of them are indigenous persons with substantial experience\nor expertise concerning indigenous heritage, at least one of whom represents the interests of indigenous people."
    },
    {
