      },
      "dc:source": "australian-heritage-council-act-2003.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "member’s duties\n\nA member must not engage in any paid employment, or any other\nactivity, that the Minister is satisfied conflicts or may conflict with\nthe proper performance of the member’s duties.",
      "skos:definition": "member’s duties\n\nA member must not engage in any paid employment, or any other\nactivity, that the Minister is satisfied conflicts or may conflict with\nthe proper performance of the member’s duties.",
      "cml:asserts": [
